<doc id="18842" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=18842" title="Alpen">
Alpen

Alpen (&lt;a href="basa%20Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; Alpen; &lt;a href="basa%20Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt; Alpi; &lt;a href="basa%20Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt; Alpes; &lt;a href="basa%20Rh%C3%A9to-Roman"&gt;Rhéto-Roman&lt;/a&gt; Alps; &lt;a href="basa%20Slow%C3%A9n"&gt;Slowén&lt;/a&gt; Alpe) iku jenengé &lt;a href="pagunungan"&gt;pagunungan&lt;/a&gt; gedhé ing &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt;, mujur wiwit saka &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Slow%C3%A9n"&gt;Slowén&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih wétan, nganti tekan &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Liechtenstein"&gt;Liechtenstein&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; nganti &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih kulon. Tembung "Alpen" dijupuk dadi &lt;a href="basa%20Prancis"&gt;basa Prancis&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;basa Latin&lt;/a&gt; Alpes (tegesé "the Alps"), kang kadayan déning tembung Latin albus (putih) utawa altus (dhuwur) utawa luwih mèmper tembung Latin kang asliné saka &lt;a href="Celtic%20languages"&gt;basa Celtic&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Ligurian%20language"&gt;basa Ligurian&lt;/a&gt;.
Pucuk kang paling dhuwur ing Alpen ya iku &lt;a href="Mont%20Blanc"&gt;Mont Blanc&lt;/a&gt;, dhuwuré watara 4808 m, ing tapel wates Prancis-Italia. Kabèh pucuk ing Alpen bisa tinemu ing &lt;a href="prat%C3%A9lan%20gunung%20ing%20Alpen"&gt;pratélan gunung ing Alpen&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="prat%C3%A9lan%20pucuk%20Alpen%20miturut%20kaunggulan"&gt;pratélan pucuk Alpen miturut kaunggulan&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Géografi</h2>
<h3>Pamérangan</h3>
Géografi.
Pamérangan.
Alpen lumrahé dipérang dadi loro, ya iku &lt;a href="Alpen%20Kulon"&gt;Alpen Kulon&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Alpen%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Alpen Wétan&lt;/a&gt;. Pamérangané miturut garis wiwit &lt;a href="Tlaga%20Constance"&gt;Tlaga Constance&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tlaga%20Como"&gt;Tlaga Como&lt;/a&gt;, nurut Kali &lt;a href="Rhine"&gt;Rhine&lt;/a&gt;. Alpen Kulon luwih dhuwur, nanging luwih ujuré cendhak lan menggak-menggok; dumunung ing &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;. Alpen Wétan (pagunungan utama) manggon ing tlatah &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Liechtenstein"&gt;Liechtenstein&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Slow%C3%A9n"&gt;Slowén&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;. Pucuk-pucuk paling dhuwur ing Alpen Kulon ya iku &lt;a href="Mont%20Blanc"&gt;Mont Blanc&lt;/a&gt;, 4808 m, &lt;a href="Mont%20Blanc%20de%20Courmayeur"&gt;Mont Blanc de Courmayeur&lt;/a&gt; 4748 m, &lt;a href="Dufourspitze"&gt;Dufourspitze&lt;/a&gt; 4634 m lan pucuk liyané ing golongan &lt;a href="Monte%20Rosa"&gt;Monte Rosa&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Dom%20%28mountain%29"&gt;Dom&lt;/a&gt;, 4545 m. Pucuk paling dhuwur ing Alpen Wétan ya iku &lt;a href="Piz%20Bernina"&gt;Piz Bernina&lt;/a&gt;, 4049 m.
Alpen Wétan lumrahé dipérang miturut béda &lt;a href="lithology"&gt;lithology&lt;/a&gt; (komposisi watu) saka pérangan kang luwih tengah lan golongan ing pinggiran lor lan kidul:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Flysch"&gt;Flysch zone&lt;/a&gt; (saka &lt;a href="Wienerwald"&gt;Wienerwald&lt;/a&gt; nganti &lt;a href="Bregenzerwald"&gt;Bregenzerwald&lt;/a&gt;). Sacara géografis, &lt;a href="Pegunungan%20Jura"&gt;Pegunungan Jura&lt;/a&gt; ora kalebu Alpen; nanging kanthi geopolitik kalebu tlatah Alpen.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Northern%20Limestone%20Alps"&gt;Northern Limestone Alps&lt;/a&gt;, pucuké nganti 3000 m</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Central%20Eastern%20Alps"&gt;Central Eastern Alps&lt;/a&gt; (Ostenrik, Switzerland), pucuké nganti 4050 m</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Southern%20Limestone%20Alps"&gt;Southern Limestone Alps&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
</ul>
Alpen Kulon lumrahé dipérang miturut géografi dadi:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Alpen%20Ligurian"&gt;Alpen Ligurian&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Alpen%20Maritime"&gt;Alpen Maritime&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Alpen%20Cottian"&gt;Alpen Cottian&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Alpen%20Dauphin%C3%A9"&gt;Alpen Dauphiné&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Alpen%20Graian"&gt;Alpen Graian&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Alpen%20Pennine"&gt;Alpen Pennine&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Alpen%20Bernese"&gt;Alpen Bernese&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Alpen%20Lepontine"&gt;Alpen Lepontine&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Alpen%20Glarus"&gt;Alpen Glarus&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Alpen%20Switserlan%20Lor-w%C3%A9tan"&gt;Alpen Switserlan Lor-wétan&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
</ul>
Pamérangan géologi béda manèh, lan ora mbédaaké antara Alpen Kulon lan Wétan: &lt;a href="helvetic%20nappes"&gt;Helveticum&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih lor, &lt;a href="Penninic%20nappes"&gt;Penninicum&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Austroalpine%20nappes"&gt;Austroalpine system&lt;/a&gt; ing tengah lan kidulé Periadriatic seam &lt;a href="Southern%20Alps%20%28geology%29"&gt;Southern Alpine system&lt;/a&gt; lan péranganing &lt;a href="Dinarides"&gt;Dinarides&lt;/a&gt;. 
