<li>&lt;a href="Komisi%20PBB%20kanggo%20pangyasa%20sosial"&gt;Komisi PBB kanggo pangyasa sosial&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http%3A//www.un.org/esa/socdev/csd"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="UNHC"&gt;Komisi PBB kanggo hak azasi manungsa&lt;/a&gt; (UNCHR) &lt;a href="http%3A//www.unhchr.ch/html/menu2/2/chr.htm"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Dibubaraké taun 2006, diganti &lt;a href="United%20Nations%20Human%20Rights%20Council"&gt;Dewan PBB kanggo hak azasi manungsa&lt;/a&gt; (UNHRC), organ ngisoran saka &lt;a href="United%20Nations%20General%20Assembly"&gt;Sidang Umum PBB&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
