Klapa ijo kena uga diarani &lt;a href="klapa%20obat"&gt;klapa obat&lt;/a&gt;, amarga &lt;a href="banyu"&gt;banyu&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="klapa"&gt;klapa&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="ijo"&gt;ijo&lt;/a&gt; iki bisa kanggo penawar &lt;a href="racun"&gt;racun&lt;/a&gt;.
dadi yèn ana wong keracunan banjur diombéni banyu klapa &lt;a href="ijo"&gt;ijo&lt;/a&gt;, bakal mari lan seger manéh.
