<li>Salat kang bisa dilakoni kanthi jama'ah antarané:</li>
<ul>
<li>Salat Fardhu</li>
<li>Salat &lt;a href="Traw%C3%A8h"&gt;Trawèh&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
<li>Salat kang kudu dilakoni kanthi jama'ah antarané:</li>
<ul>
