Saint Lucia iku &lt;a href="nagara"&gt;nagara&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kapuloan"&gt;kapuloan&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Sagara%20Karibia"&gt;Sagara Karibia&lt;/a&gt; pérangan wétan kang wewatesan karo &lt;a href="Samodra%20Atlantik"&gt;Samodra Atlantik&lt;/a&gt;. Minangka péranganing &lt;a href="Antilles%20Cilik"&gt;Antilles Cilik&lt;/a&gt;, Saint Lucia dumunung ana ing loré &lt;a href="Saint%20Vincent%20lan%20Grenadines"&gt;Saint Vincent lan Grenadines&lt;/a&gt; lan kidulé &lt;a href="Martinique"&gt;Martinique&lt;/a&gt;.
