<doc id="19801" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=19801" title="Abkhazia">
Abkhazia

Abkhazia (&lt;a href="basa%20Abkhaz"&gt;basa Abkhaz&lt;/a&gt;: Аҧсны/Apsny, &lt;a href="basa%20Georgia"&gt;basa Georgia&lt;/a&gt;: აფხაზეთი/Apkhazeti, &lt;a href="basa%20Ruslan"&gt;basa Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;: Абха́зия/Abkhazia), iku nagara kang ora diakoni ing bawana &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt;, kajaba, déning &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; kang ngakoni ing tanggal &lt;a href="26%20Agustus"&gt;26 Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt; bebarengan karo pangakon kedaulatan &lt;a href="Ossetia%20Kidul"&gt;Ossetia Kidul&lt;/a&gt;.. Tlatah iki dumunung ana ing &lt;a href="Kaukasus"&gt;Kaukasus&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Georgia"&gt;Georgia&lt;/a&gt; ngeklaim Abkhazia minangka wewengkon kadaulatané. Kutha krajan nagara iki yaiku &lt;a href="Sokhumi"&gt;Sokhumi&lt;/a&gt;. Nagara iki kang ndunungi 157.000 nganti 216.000 jiwa lan jembaré ana 8.600&amp;nbsp;km2.
<h2>Divisi administratif</h2>
Divisi administratif.
Republik Abkhazia dipunperang dados pitu raion (distrik) ingkang dipunsukani nami sami kaliyan namining kitha utaminipun: &lt;a href="Distrik%20Gagra"&gt;Gagra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Distrik%20Gudauta"&gt;Gudauta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Distrik%20Sukhumi"&gt;Sukhumi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Distrik%20Ochamchira"&gt;Ochamchira&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Distrik%20Gulripshi"&gt;Gulripshi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Distrik%20Tkvarcheli"&gt;Tkvarcheli&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Distrik%20Gali%2C%20Abkhazia"&gt;Gali&lt;/a&gt;. Distrik-distrik puniki saperangan ageng tetep ajeg wiwit bibaripun &lt;a href="Uni%20Soviet"&gt;Uni Soviet&lt;/a&gt;, kejawi Distrik Tkvarcheli, ingkang dipunbentuk ing 1995 saking saperangan Distrik Ochamchira lan Gali. 
