Shabeellaha Dhexe

Shabele Tengah (&lt;a href="Basa%20Somali"&gt;Basa Somali&lt;/a&gt;: Shabeellaha Dhexe) iku siji laladan administratif (&lt;a href="gobolka"&gt;gobolka&lt;/a&gt;) ing &lt;a href="Somalia"&gt;Somalia&lt;/a&gt; kidul. Minangka péranganing tilas laladan &lt;a href="Benadir"&gt;Benadir&lt;/a&gt;, kutha krajané ya iku &lt;a href="Mogadishu"&gt;Mogadishu&lt;/a&gt; nganti tengah taun &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;-an, sabanjuré kutha &lt;a href="Jowhar"&gt;Jowhar&lt;/a&gt; dadi kutha krajan. Laladan iki wewatesan karo laladan &lt;a href="Galguduud"&gt;Galguduud&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hiiraan"&gt;Hiiraan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Shabeellaha%20Hoose"&gt;Shabele Ngisor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Banaadir"&gt;Banaadir&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Samodra%20Hindia"&gt;Samodra Hindia&lt;/a&gt;.
Jeneng laladan iki dijupuk saka jeneng Kali Shabeelle kang ngliwati tlatah iki.
